// A shared overlap keeps the concept name, then the longer word.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE word ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG word law

IMPULSE word 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "word" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
